dence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p018","quote":"懿公之立也，百姓大臣皆不服。自懿公父惠公朔之讒殺太子伋代立至於懿公，常欲敗之，卒滅惠公之後而更立黔牟之弟昭伯頑之子申爲君，是爲戴公。戴公申元年卒。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p019","quote":"齊桓公以衞數亂，乃率諸侯伐翟，爲衞築楚丘，立戴公弟燬爲衞君，是爲文公。文公以亂故奔齊，齊人入之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","quote":"初，翟殺懿公也，衞人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公爲君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔牟皆已前死，故立昭伯子申爲戴公。戴公卒，復立其弟燬爲文公。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與追稱、衛世系及具體事件暫定所列提及同指；每段原文附存，不按同名字面跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p018","text":"懿公之立也，百姓大臣皆不服。自懿公父惠公朔之讒殺太子伋代立至於懿公，常欲敗之，卒滅惠公之後而更立黔牟之弟昭伯頑之子申爲君，是爲戴公。戴公申元年卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"惠公朔","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"太子伋","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"懿公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"黔牟","kind":"person","person_id":"78j_6yv_eaf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"昭伯頑","kind":"person","person_id":"kt8_3kv_44r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m018-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"申","kind":"person","person_